#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Run a named group of independent differential suites, as CI does.

Groups are split so CI can run them in parallel; together they are the complete
development differential gate. The mutation suite runs separately in shards
(tools/test_mutations.py --shard) and the strict completion gate stays last.
"""
